@page "/"
@using Ch11_App.Client.Shared

<h2>Blazor WebAssembly by Example</h2>
<h3>Chapter 11</h3>
This project includes the following pages:
<ul>
    <li><b>Home</b>: This page.</li>
    <li><b>Login</b>: Allows users to login. </li>
    <li><b>Secure</b>: A secure page accessible only to authenticated users.</li>
    <li><b>Secure Admin</b>: A secure page accessible only to authenticated users in the "admin" role.</li>
    <li><b>Show Users Name</b>: Shows the name of the authenticated user.</li>
</ul>

